{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7657124904055130414","title":"BMS硬件工程师-2027校招","description":"1、参与智能电池产品中BMS硬件的方案设计、器件选型、原理图设计与PCB评审；\n2、与相关团队紧密协作，理解产品需求，制定高可靠性、高安全性的硬件实现方案；\n3、完成板级调试、信号测试、EMC整改及转产支持，确保硬件从设计到量产的高质量交付。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，电子、电气、自动化、通信、微电子等相关专业，具备扎实的电路理论基础；\n2、熟悉常见电源拓扑（DC-DC、LDO等）及模拟电路，了解MCU外围电路、IIC/SPI/UART等接口设计，能够使用示波器、电子负载等仪器进行调试；\n3、对电池管理系统（BMS）、电量计、均衡电路或快充协议（USB-C PD等）有基础了解或项目实践者优先；\n4、优秀责任心与团队协作能力，具备良好的上进心与学习能力，心态积极开放；\n5、有竞赛或BMS相关行业实习经验优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1782813454546,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7657124139183343899","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}